 *   [1, 1, 1, 1]        ->  [1, 1, 1, 1]        only mid moves
 *   []                  ->  []                  loop never runs
 *
 *  The approach notes (APPROACH, KEY INSIGHT, COMPLEXITY, ...) are hidden in practice mode.
 *  The Hint button shows them one at a time.
